    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2155388050",
      "Source": "This item is designed to activate evolution of your Nameless king to next level creature. Follow this steps:<#N#>- Craft this item on Tek Replicator or Pandora box<#N#>- Open Nameless King Inventory and put the Evolve Item inside<#N#>- Mount your Nameless King and PRESS Left CTRL+X",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此物品用于激活无名之王进化至下一阶生物。遵循以下步骤：<#N#>- 在泰克复制器或潘多拉之盒中制作此物品<#N#>- 打开无名之王的背包并放入进化物品<#N#>- 骑上你的无名之王并按下左CTRL+X","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
