      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::392590717",
      "Source": "Raphus have a option to change his look to 2 TEK looked models. To can do this you need to:<#N#>- Put 10 elements on his inventory<#N#>-TO REMOVE SADDLE!!!!!! AND COLLECT EVERYTHING IMPORTANT FROM IT INVENTORY!!!<#N#>- Dismount your Dodorex and press \"Ë\" to get access to the Option Wheel<#N#>- Choose wich variant you want to make<#N#>- Wait the time to can activate the option and that is - You have new looking Raphus. All items from it inventory will dissapear!!! Will not reset his experience/level progress",
      "Trans": {"SC":"Raphus有一个选项可以将外观更改为2种泰克风格模型。要做到这一点，你需要：<#N#>- 在它的背包中放入10个元素<#N#>- 移除鞍具！！！！！！并从它的背包中收集所有重要物品！！！<#N#>- 从你的渡渡霸王龙上下来，按下“Ë”以打开选项轮盘<#N#>- 选择你想要制作的变体<#N#>- 等待激活选项的时间，这样你就有了新外观的Raphus。它背包中的所有物品都会消失！！！不会重置它的经验/等级进度","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::611813198",
